(doc
  (title "Step 0: Python Build Configuration")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (kv "Version" "0.1.0")
  (kv "Step ID" "ybs-step_000000000000")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Collect all configuration parameters for building the YX Python implementation and set up the build workspace. After this step, all subsequent steps run autonomously with zero user interaction."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "A `builds/<build_name>/` workspace containing `BUILD_CONFIG.json`, `BUILD_STATUS.sxp`, and `SESSION.md`, plus the initial directory scaffolding for a Python project. This is the foundation all other steps build on top of."))
  (section
    (heading "Step Objectives")
    (item "1. Check for existing `BUILD_CONFIG.json` — skip questions if found")
    (item "2. Collect: build name, Python version, whether to generate tests")
    (item "3. Create `builds/<build_name>/` directory tree")
    (item "4. Write `BUILD_CONFIG.json` with all collected values")
    (item "5. Write `BUILD_STATUS.sxp` with initial progress tracking")
    (item "6. Write `SESSION.md` for crash recovery")
    (item "7. Point to Step 1 (`ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6`)"))
  (section
    (heading "Prerequisites")
    (item "`yx/` project root exists")
    (item "Python 3.10+ installed and on `$PATH`")
    (item "pip available"))
  (section
    (heading "Configurable Values")
    (item "`{{CONFIG:build_name|string|Build directory name|python-impl}}`")
    (item "`{{CONFIG:enable_tests|boolean|Generate unit tests for each step|true}}`")
    (item "`{{CONFIG:python_version|string|Minimum Python version|3.10}}`"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (para "**Implements**:")
    (item "`python/specs/technical/ybs-spec_3f7a9c2e1b4d.sxp` FR-1 (Module Structure setup)")
    (item "YBS methodology — Step 0: Configuration Collection")
    (para "**References**:")
    (item "`protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp`")
    (item "`python/specs/testing/ybs-spec_8b2d5e9f1a3c.sxp`"))
  (section
    (heading "Instructions")
    (subsection
      (heading "Before Starting — Record Start Time")
      (para "Record the current timestamp in ISO 8601 format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ` This is used for the DONE file duration calculation."))
    (subsection
      (heading "1. Check for Existing Configuration")
      (code "test -f builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json && echo \"EXISTS\"")
      (para "**If BUILD_CONFIG.json exists:**")
      (item "Read and display the configuration")
      (item "Skip all questions below")
      (item "Proceed directly to Step 1 (`python/steps/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6.sxp`)")
      (para "**If BUILD_CONFIG.json does NOT exist:** continue to step 2."))
    (subsection
      (heading "2. Collect Configuration Values")
      (para "Ask the user:")
      (para "**Question 1: Build directory name**")
      (code "Build name (default: python-impl):
Examples: python-impl, dev, experiment-1")
      (para "**Question 2: Python version**")
      (code "Minimum Python version (default: 3.10):
Examples: 3.10, 3.11, 3.12")
      (para "**Question 3: Generate tests**")
      (code "Generate unit tests for each step? (true/false, default: true):"))
    (subsection
      (heading "3. Create Build Directory Structure")
      (code "mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/src
mkdir -p builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/tests"))
    (subsection
      (heading "4. Create BUILD_CONFIG.json")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json`:")
      (code "{
  \"version\": \"1.0\",
  \"generated\": \"<ISO 8601 timestamp>\",
  \"system\": \"yx-python\",
  \"ybs_version\": \"2.0.0\",
  \"values\": {
    \"build_name\": \"{{CONFIG:build_name}}\",
    \"language\": \"python\",
    \"enable_tests\": {{CONFIG:enable_tests}},
    \"python_version\": \"{{CONFIG:python_version}}\"
  },
  \"metadata\": {
    \"step_sequence\": \"python\",
    \"config_sources\": [\"ybs-step_000000000000\"],
    \"protocol_specs\": \"protocol/specs/\",
    \"impl_specs\": \"python/specs/\"
  }
}"))
    (subsection
      (heading "5. Create BUILD_STATUS.sxp")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp`:")
      (code "# Build Status: {{CONFIG:build_name}}

**System**: yx-python
**Language**: Python {{CONFIG:python_version}}+
**Started**: <timestamp>
**Last Updated**: <timestamp>
**Status**: 🔄 IN PROGRESS

## Progress

- [x] Step 0: Build Configuration
- [ ] Step 1: Project Setup           (ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6)
- [ ] Step 2: GUID Factory            (ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1)
- [ ] Step 3: Packet Structure        (ybs-step_c3d4e5f6a1b2)
- [ ] Step 4: HMAC Computation        (ybs-step_d4e5f6a1b2c3)
- [ ] Step 5: Packet Builder          (ybs-step_e5f6a1b2c3d4)
- [ ] Step 6: Packet Parser           (ybs-step_f6a1b2c3d4e5)
- [ ] Step 7: UDP Socket              (ybs-step_a2b3c4d5e6f7)
- [ ] Step 8: UDP Send/Receive        (ybs-step_b3c4d5e6f7a2)
- [ ] Step 9: Integration Tests       (ybs-step_c4d5e6f7a2b3)
- [ ] Step 10: Canonical Artifacts    (ybs-step_d5e6f7a2b3c4)
- [ ] Step 11: Protocol 0 (Text)      (ybs-step_g1h2i3j4k5l6)
- [ ] Step 12: Protocol 1 (Binary)    (ybs-step_h2i3j4k5l6m7)
- [ ] Step 13: Security               (ybs-step_i3j4k5l6m7n8)
- [ ] Step 14: SimplePacketBuilder    (ybs-step_j4k5l6m7n8o9)
- [ ] Step 15: Interop Tests          (ybs-step_k5l6m7n8o9p0)

## Metrics

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Steps Completed | 1 / 16 |
| Tests Passing | 0 / 0 |
| Code Coverage | 0% |
| Traceability | 0% |

## Issues

None."))
    (subsection
      (heading "6. Create SESSION.md")
      (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/SESSION.md`:")
      (code "# Session: {{CONFIG:build_name}}

**System**: yx-python
**Build**: {{CONFIG:build_name}}
**Started**: <timestamp>
**Last Updated**: <timestamp>

## Current Status

Step 0 complete. Ready to execute Step 1 (Project Setup).

## Configuration

- Language: Python {{CONFIG:python_version}}+
- Tests enabled: {{CONFIG:enable_tests}}
- Build dir: builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/

## Next Actions

1. Execute `python/steps/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6.sxp` (Step 1: Project Setup)
2. Follow step sequence in `python/steps/STEPS_ORDER.txt`
3. Update BUILD_STATUS.sxp and this file after each step"))
    (subsection
      (heading "7. Display Summary")
      (code "✓ Configuration complete!

  System:        yx-python
  Build name:    {{CONFIG:build_name}}
  Build dir:     builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/
  Python:        {{CONFIG:python_version}}+
  Tests:         {{CONFIG:enable_tests}}

→ Next: python/steps/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6.sxp (Step 1: Project Setup)")))
  (section
    (heading "Verification")
    (para "**This step is complete when:**")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json` exists and is valid JSON")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp` exists")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/SESSION.md` exists")
    (item "[ ] `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history/` directory exists")
    (para "**Verification Commands:**")
    (code "# Verify BUILD_CONFIG.json is valid JSON
python3 -m json.tool builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_CONFIG.json > /dev/null && \\
  echo \"✓ BUILD_CONFIG.json valid\"

# Verify required files
test -f builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/BUILD_STATUS.sxp && echo \"✓ BUILD_STATUS.sxp exists\"
test -f builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/SESSION.md && echo \"✓ SESSION.md exists\"
test -d builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history && echo \"✓ build-history dir exists\"")
    (para "**Expected Output:**")
    (code "✓ BUILD_CONFIG.json valid
✓ BUILD_STATUS.sxp exists
✓ SESSION.md exists
✓ build-history dir exists")
    (para "**Retry Policy:**")
    (item "Maximum 3 attempts")
    (item "On failure: check write permissions, verify Python is available")
    (item "After 3 failures: STOP and report to user"))
  (section
    (heading "Documentation")
    (para "**Record end time** and calculate duration.")
    (para "Create `builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}/docs/build-history/ybs-step_000000000000-DONE.txt`:")
    (code "STEP ybs-step_000000000000: Python Build Configuration
STARTED:    [start timestamp]
COMPLETED:  [end timestamp]
DURATION:   [minutes]

OBJECTIVES COMPLETED:
- Configuration collected (or loaded from existing BUILD_CONFIG.json)
- Build directory structure created
- BUILD_CONFIG.json, BUILD_STATUS.sxp, SESSION.md written

VERIFICATION: PASSED (attempt [N])

NEXT STEP: ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6 (Project Setup)"))
  (section
    (heading "Success Criteria")
    (item "1. All verification checks pass")
    (item "2. Agent can read BUILD_CONFIG.json values for use in Steps 1-15")
    (item "3. DONE file created")
    (item "4. No user interaction required for any subsequent step"))
  (section
    (heading "Next Steps")
    (kv "Next" "`ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6` — Project Setup"))
  (section
    (heading "Version History")
    (subsection
      (heading "0.1.0 (2026-04-11)")
      (item "Initial creation, Python-specific Step 0 (split from shared Step 0)"))))
